# Local working rules, loaded by any Claude Code session here and never published.
CLAUDE.local.md

# Agent governance store: role memory, sweep logs, warm-resume journals. Internal working
# material for whoever maintains this repo with an AI agent — never part of the published
# standard, never meant for a reader of the doc. Untracked-but-not-ignored here would let a
# routine `git add -A` publish it to this repo's public GitHub remote.
.claude/

# Scratch/working files from agent sessions (drafts, throwaway probes). Same reasoning as
# .claude/ above: internal, never published, and this repo has a real remote to leak onto.
scratchpad/
